<th id="A4.T9.4.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding:0.25pt 7.0pt;"><span id="A4.T9.4.12.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TCN-Supervised (BCE)</span></th>
